      "text": "A histogram uses intervals 0–10, 10–20 and 20–50 minutes with frequencies 20, 30 and 45. Its bars have heights 20, 30 and 45. Choose the correct criticism: 1 = all histograms need equal frequencies; 2 = unequal class widths require frequency-density heights; 3 = the intervals must start at 1."
    }
